The '''Korakanni Mound''' was a location on the [[planet]] [[Geonosis]]. During the [[Imperial Era|reign]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], a group of [[saboteur]]s led by a [[Unidentified Geonosian queen|rogue]] [[Geonosian]] [[queen]] were based in the Korakanni Mound, and sabotaged the Empire's [[Project Stardust|construction]] of the [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]]. After learning that the saboteurs had sent [[Galen Walton Erso|Galen Erso]] an [[ootheca]], [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] and a contingent of [[death trooper]]s traveled to the Korakanni Mound and [[Skirmish in the Korakanni Mound|executed]] the saboteurs for their treachery against the Empire.<ref name="Annual 2" />

